spans.s:
Susaṃprasthita,
(1) one of sixteen satpuruṣa, q.v.: SP 〔3.12〕 (Kernʼs Transl. Susaṃsthita with v.l., but Tib. śin tu yaṅ dag zhugs, supporting ed.);
(2) n. of a Bodhisattva (possibly to be identified with 1?): Mvy 〔718〕; ŚsP 〔6.16〕.

Susaṃbhava,
(1) n. of a king: Suv 〔146.10 ff.〕; previous incarnation of Śākyamuni, 〔152.12〕; ˚va-parivarta, n. of Chap. xiii of Suv, 〔145.8〕;
(2) n. of a kalpa: Gv 〔258.3〕.

Susārthavāha,
(1) n. of a satpuruṣa, q.v.: SP 〔3.11〕;
(2) n. of a Bodhisattva: Mvy 〔697〕; ŚsP 〔6.7〕 (to be identified with 1?).

Susīma,
(1) (= Pali id.) n. of a devaputra: Mvy 〔3136〕; RP 〔2.4〕;
(2) n. of a son of Bindusāra: Divy 〔369.14〕; 〔372.16 ff.〕
